		"│ Help · Start here                                                                                                              │",
		"│ ❯ 1 Start here      │ The session list on the left, the pane on the right: → steps in, ← or Esc back out. Everywhere: Enter    │",
		"│   2 Sessions        │ opens, Space toggles, E opens your editor; in lists a adds, x removes (on the session list: a Notes      │",
		"│   3 Sidebar         │ tab, x stop).                                                                                            │",
		"│   4 Find & organize │                                                                                                          │",
		"│   5 Panes           │ n         New session: agent, name, Tab for the workspace (↑↓ a new worktree's base), Enter launches     │",
		"│   6 Notes           │ j k  ↑↓   Select a session (or type its number)                                                          │",
		"│   7 Tasks           │ Enter  o  Open it full screen: the agent, or what the tab shows (shell, Git, Dev); on Notes, Enter       │",
		"│   8 Worktrees       │           edits them here, o in vim                                                                      │",
		"│   9 Git & PRs       │ Ctrl+]    Back to Deckhand from full screen (Ctrl+Space works too)                                       │",
		"│  10 Dev & actions   │ Tab  [ ]  Next / previous tab: Preview, Terminal, Git, Dev, Notes (Shift+Tab goes back too)              │",
		"│  11 Settings        │ b  W      Tasks: the repository's task list (n starts a session from one) / Worktrees: what is merged,   │",
		"│                     │           delete them                                                                                    │",
		"│                     │ C  U      Settings / Agents: versions and updates (Enter updates, r re-checks)                           │",
		"│                     │ ?         This guide (↑↓ or 1-9 pick a topic, / searches, Esc closes)                                    │",
